# AgentX-owned URI prefixes.
#
# RO entries under these URI prefixes skip local netsnmp_register_*
# in ies-auto-mibs and are served by the ISS subagent via AgentX
# (consumed by mox_snmp_init_entry in 3rdparty_net_snmp).
#
# RW entries always stay local — they keep going through the
# URI/framework REST path so JSON persistence stays the source of truth.
#
# Format: one URI prefix per line. '#' starts a comment. Blanks OK.
# Add a trailing '/' on each prefix to avoid accidental partial matches
# (e.g. "ifmibdb" would also match "ifmibdbExtra/...").

ifmibdb/
